@startuml
title Phase 2 目标依赖（设计，尚未完成运行接入）
package "host / composition" as host
package "generic loader（宿主侧）" as loader
package "CLI kernel" as kernel
package "public extensions" as api
package "public domain" as domain
package "builtin implementations" as builtin
package "optional plugins" as plugins
package "IO adapters" as io
host --> loader
host --> kernel
host --> builtin
host --> io
loader --> api
kernel --> api
kernel --> domain
api --> domain
builtin --> api
builtin --> domain
plugins --> api
plugins --> domain
io --> api
note right of loader
  按模块字符串解析
  无具体插件导入/名字映射
end note
note right of plugins
  不依赖宿主或内核内部实现
  A/B 经同一安装服务校验
end note
@enduml
